      "content": "fair enough, but when you say \"extreme views,\" what do you mean by that? are you talking about people who think the energy transition is just a pipe dream because of the tech hurdles, or are you referring to something else? just trying to gauge if the economic risks are actually significant or if they're just being overblown by the industry.",
